		{"name":"tcforms","arg":{"format":"{}","snippet":"tcforms{${1:formslist}}"},"doc":"The command \\tcforms will generate the many forms (⟨formslist⟩) using the information from local.tex, whilst \\tcemptyforms will generate said forms with ’blanks’ (to be filled by hand, for instance)."}
